WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:18.703
Ben blinked in surprise as he looked from the gold jewelry to Dr. Bones.

2
00:00:18.704 --> 00:00:21.493
The guards rushed toward her.

3
00:00:21.493 --> 00:00:26.358
"Where's the rest of the loot?" Hazel demanded. "Confess!"

4
00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:30.030
Dr. Bones scowled. "This is ridiculous.

5
00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:34.059
Why would I steal from my own museum?"

6
00:00:34.059 --> 00:00:39.068
"Maybe the museum isn't paying you enough," Bob suggested.

7
00:00:39.069 --> 00:00:44.054
"Maybe she's trying to make monsters look bad!" Mr. Freaky snapped.

8
00:00:44.055 --> 00:00:49.144
"This is absurd!" Dr. Bones said, sighing.

9
00:00:49.145 --> 00:00:55.990
"I'm going to call the police. They'll find the real culprit."

10
00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:02.485
"Stay right there!" ordered Bob.

11
00:01:02.485 --> 00:01:08.711
He pushed Dr. Bones into a chair.

12
00:01:08.712 --> 00:01:13.568
Ben watched the two guards huddle, listening as they whispered back and forth.

13
00:01:13.569 --> 00:01:16.462
"It's too soon to call the police."

14
00:01:16.462 --> 00:01:22.602
"If we can find the rest of the loot, the mayor will probably give us a reward!"

15
00:01:22.603 --> 00:01:25.775
Mr. Freaky's face was turning redder and redder.

16
00:01:25.775 --> 00:01:28.872
"Call the police right now!" he demanded.

17
00:01:28.872 --> 00:01:34.079
"If you don't, I'm going to take all the students back to Monsterville!"

18
00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:38.575
"You're not going anywhere, buddy!" Hazel snarled.

19
00:01:38.576 --> 00:01:41.698
"We have a plan," the other guard said.

20
00:01:41.699 --> 00:01:46.189
"We'll call the police if we don't find the jewels by morning."

21
00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:50.945
"You can't hold us here all night!" Dr. Bones complained.

22
00:01:50.945 --> 00:01:54.538
"Yes, we can." Bob grinned.

23
00:01:54.538 --> 00:02:00.803
"We'll lock you in the Old West jail exhibit."

24
00:02:00.803 --> 00:02:04.055
"What about those zombies?" Ben said.

25
00:02:04.055 --> 00:02:10.649
Hazel shrugged. "The only zombies I see are the ones in your group."

26
00:02:10.649 --> 00:02:14.288
"Grr!" Ben growled with frustration.

27
00:02:14.288 --> 00:02:18.246
"This is an outrage!" Mr. Freaky stamped a foot.

28
00:02:18.247 --> 00:02:21.230
"Wait till Mayor Hubbletree hears how we've been treated.

29
00:02:21.247 --> 00:02:24.072
He said people would be friendly and kind.

30
00:02:24.073 --> 00:02:26.650
But instead we've been treated like—"

31
00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:34.659
"Monsters!" Bob snapped.

32
00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:39.632
The guards left Ben and Dr. Bones in the director's office.

33
00:02:39.633 --> 00:02:45.581
They locked the rest of the monsters in the classrooms and then grabbed Ben and Dr. Bones.

34
00:02:45.581 --> 00:02:51.891
"We're taking you to jail!" Hazel said.

35
00:02:51.892 --> 00:02:59.241
They dragged their prisoners to the Old West exhibit, and then hurried off to search for Egyptian treasure.

36
00:02:59.241 --> 00:03:05.079
Dr. Bones had been very quiet.

37
00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.039
"Your guards aren't very smart," Ben said.

38
00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.724
"I'm a ghost. I can float out of this fake jail cell whenever I want."

39
00:03:12.724 --> 00:03:17.693
Dr. Bones sighed. "This is the mayor's fault.

40
00:03:17.693 --> 00:03:22.332
He's the one who cut the museum's budget last year.

41
00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:28.270
We couldn't afford real security guards, so I had to hire those two."

42
00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.513
"Did you steal the jewels?" Ben blurted out.

43
00:03:31.513 --> 00:03:34.451
"Of course not!" Dr. Bones snapped.

44
00:03:34.451 --> 00:03:39.370
"Why would I leave one in my coat? And where are the rest of them?"

45
00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.963
Ben rested his chin in his hands, thinking.

46
00:03:42.963 --> 00:03:47.707
"We'll just have to wait for the police," Dr. Bones said.

47
00:03:47.707 --> 00:03:53.531
"If we wait for the police," Ben said, "the real crooks might get away.

48
00:03:53.531 --> 00:03:58.450
The real thieves could even be working with those guards!"

49
00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:04.753
Dr. Bones' eyes went wide. "You're right! Uh-oh.

50
00:04:04.754 --> 00:04:10.772
They could all escape while we're stuck in here. We have to do something."

51
00:04:10.772 --> 00:04:13.213
Ben had an idea.

52
00:04:13.213 --> 00:04:22.828
"When the alarm went off, did you see any zombies run through the construction site?"

53
00:04:22.828 --> 00:04:26.904
Dr. Bones shook her head. "No."

54
00:04:26.905 --> 00:04:31.463
"Well, then the real thieves must still be in the museum."

55
00:04:31.464 --> 00:04:37.085
Ben floated through the bars of the jail cell. "Don't worry. I'll be back soon."

56
00:04:37.085 --> 00:04:41.384
"I'm not sure this is a good idea!" Dr. Bones called.

57
00:04:41.385 --> 00:04:47.076
But Ben was already floating through the museum to the lobby.

58
00:04:47.076 --> 00:04:52.169
"The thieves went into the construction area," he murmured.

59
00:04:52.169 --> 00:04:56.155
"But they didn't come out in the education wing.

60
00:04:56.155 --> 00:05:00.045
Maybe they're hiding inside the construction area."

61
00:05:00.045 --> 00:05:08.327
Ben drifted into the construction area, searching among the tools and scaffolding for clues.

62
00:05:08.327 --> 00:05:12.847
He spotted some old clothes and masks in a trash bucket.

63
00:05:12.847 --> 00:05:19.609
"Whoa!" he cried. "Those are zombie costumes!"

64
00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.619
"Ben?" someone called.

65
00:05:21.619 --> 00:05:25.567
Ben looked up. Winnie and Cleo were hurrying toward him.

66
00:05:25.567 --> 00:05:34.265
Behind them was Waldo, hobbling on his sore ankle.

67
00:05:34.265 --> 00:05:38.107
"I zapped the door locks open," Waldo explained.

68
00:05:38.107 --> 00:05:42.125
"We went to the Old West exhibit," said Winnie.

69
00:05:42.125 --> 00:05:46.737
"Dr. Bones told us you were searching the museum."

70
00:05:46.737 --> 00:05:48.886
Ben pointed to the trash can.

71
00:05:48.886 --> 00:05:54.697
"I found some disguises. The zombies are people!"

72
00:05:54.697 --> 00:05:57.701
"Those creeps!" Cleo said.

73
00:05:57.701 --> 00:06:02.368
"The two security guards are looking around the museum too," Ben said.

74
00:06:02.368 --> 00:06:05.834
"They think they can get a reward, or a—"

75
00:06:05.834 --> 00:06:10.574
"Shh!" Winnie hushed him. "Do you hear voices?"

76
00:06:10.574 --> 00:06:12.765
Ben nodded.

77
00:06:12.766 --> 00:06:17.104
"How long do we have to wait here?" a man was complaining.

78
00:06:17.104 --> 00:06:20.202
"Until tomorrow morning," said another voice.

79
00:06:20.203 --> 00:06:23.097
"Then we show up like it's a regular workday.

80
00:06:23.098 --> 00:06:27.432
When no one is looking, we'll sneak out and never come back."

81
00:06:27.432 --> 00:06:34.995
"Ha-ha! We'll never have to see that snooty Dr. Bones or ask for a raise again!"

82
00:06:34.995 --> 00:06:39.220
"Because she'll be in jail!" said the second voice.

83
00:06:39.221 --> 00:06:41.308
Ben looked around.

84
00:06:41.308 --> 00:06:45.671
The voices seemed to be coming from inside a newly built wall.

85
00:06:45.672 --> 00:06:50.621
Were the thieves hiding inside?
